URLPattern: the standard's newer rules. test() and exec() take an optional
input (default {}), and a lone wildcard or regexp group (regexp "^(.*)$")
reports its own group name, not "0", e.g. :domain(.*) (urlpattern/
urlpattern.any.js; Deno fails both).

